==English==
[[Image:Joe facepalm.jpg|thumb|A facepalm]]
===Pronunciation===
*{{audio|Media:en-us-facepalm.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Etymology===
From {{term|face||lang=en}} + {{term|palm||lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To bring the palm of one's hand to one's face in mixed [[humor]] and [[disbelief]] or [[disgust]], for example, when one is caught [[off-guard]] with a particularly bad pun.
# To bring one's face down to one's [[cupped]] hand or hands.

====Usage notes====
*Found primarily in real-time text communication on the Internet.